droidloom (0.1.0-49) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package release 49 of Droidloom for Debian based hosts.
  * Split the host runtime, the Android runtime images and the rarely changing
    Android partitions into droidloom-runtime, droidloom-image and
    droidloom-base, mirroring the Arch Linux package names.

